# Databento data pulls.
#
# Raw pulls are never committed: they are large and Databento's licence
# restricts redistribution of their data. `data/processed/` is ignored by
# default for the same licensing reason -- if the group decides the derived
# settlement series is OK to share, remove that line and commit it so that
# teammates do not each have to spend credits re-pulling.
data/raw/
data/processed/
.cache/

__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.pytest_cache/
.venv/
